      ],
      "message": "rest: fix getutxos request body decoding\n\nBinary GET and POST requests for the same outpoints incorrectly return different UTXO results. Writing the POST body to DataStream with operator<< serializes it as a string and prepends a CompactSize length, which the parser incorrectly reads as request fields.\n\nInitialize the stream from the supplied body bytes. The existing comparison now requires GET and POST responses to match.",
